    "description": "Dog-sized, scorpion-like creatures, Drilltails were originally used by wildcatters who lacked the funding to employ larger drilling Xalians like the Frackworm. Drilltails use their small, stinger-like drills to quickly tunnel through the earth, darting in and out of the surface as they hunt for prey to ambush with their sharp, scissor-like claws.",
